- Jacob.

539
00:48:53.041 --> 00:48:54.442
Jake Dutton!

540
00:49:01.816 --> 00:49:04.118
I'm a man of my word!

541
00:49:04.819 --> 00:49:05.854
- Run.

542
00:50:10.651 --> 00:50:12.053
