00:52:59.587 --> 00:53:01.622
Put Elizabeth on that
table over there.

562
00:53:02.790 --> 00:53:04.792
There scissors. top
drawer. Two pair.

563
00:53:04.825 --> 00:53:06.260
Bring them. both of them.

564
00:53:06.294 --> 00:53:09.663
Carl. Carl. through that door on
